SST Influence on Temperature in PVD RI - PJ Maresca

Objective: To correlate distance and direction to Atlantic Ocean with springtime teperature across the Provide Metro Area
Hypotheses: Distance and angle of a vector from a particular weather station in providence metro area toi the nearest ocean body of water will help predict daily maximum temperatyure in the months March, April, and May. Those stations with a shallower angle and closer proximity to Naragansett Bay will feel stronger effects of southerly winds of the water and will maintain cooler average highs over entire month than those with greater angle and greater distance.  

 
